OL,3,GNEWSAWhat could the UK-EU deal mean for
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK and the EU have reached a draft
OL,7,Fdeal on food and plant products which
OL,8,Fis likely to have a significant impact
OL,9,Fon Northern Ireland and its post-Brexit
OL,10,FIrish Sea border.
OL,12,FIf passed, the deal could benefit
OL,13,Fexporters based in Great Britain as it
OL,14,Fwould reduce the extra costs and
OL,15,Fpaperwork they face when selling goods
OL,16,Fto EU states and Northern Ireland.
OL,18,FIt should also remove many of the
OL,19,Fpost-Brexit goods checks between GB and
OL,20,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
