OL,3,GNEWSAWhat could the UK-EU deal mean for
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the deal would not cut all Brexit
OL,7,Fred tape entirely because Northern
OL,8,FIreland would still be the only part of
OL,9,Fthe UK that must follow EU customs
OL,10,Frules.
